                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>SUVs</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='9'>: The highest claimant is a married, middle-aged female (ID: 528501969) with a high school education, filing $65,795 in claims. Second is an unmarried senior female (ID: 221090865) with $61,678 in claims.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
